---
// David Sloan Wilson feature. Photo left, prosecutorial copy right.
// Portrait is a styled placeholder until a real photo is added via the CMS.
---

<section class="relative section section-tight overflow-hidden" id="dsw">
  <div class="container-x relative z-10">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Portrait (placeholder) -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <div
          class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden border border-white/[0.08]"
          style="box-shadow:0 30px 80px -40px rgba(0, 212, 212,0.35)"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/dsw.jpg"
            alt="Snow-capped Cascade peaks emerging from cloud"
            class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover"
          />
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0"
            style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(8,8,8,0.2) 0%, rgba(8,8,8,0.85) 100%)"
          >
          </div>
          <!-- Monogram + name plate -->
          <div class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
            <span class="headline text-cyan text-[7rem] leading-none opacity-90">DSW</span>
          </div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-6">
            <p class="headline text-3xl text-white">David Sloan Wilson</p>
            <p class="mono-label text-cyan mt-1">Evolutionary Biologist · Co-host</p>
          </div>
          <span
            class="absolute top-4 right-4 mono-label text-white/35 !text-[0.55rem] border border-white/15 px-2 py-1"
          >Portrait · via CMS</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Copy -->
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow mb-7 reveal">The Guy</p>

        <h2
          class="headline text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5.5rem)] text-white leading-[0.92] reveal"
          style="transition-delay:0.06s"
        >
          The most important<br />
          <span class="text-cyan-glow">scientist alive.</span>
        </h2>

        <p
          class="headline text-2xl md:text-3xl text-white/80 mt-6 reveal"
          style="transition-delay:0.1s"
        >
          He would never say that. So we will.
        </p>

        <p
          class="text-lg text-white/70 leading-relaxed mt-8 max-w-prose2 reveal"
          style="transition-delay:0.12s"
        >
          David Sloan Wilson has spent fifty years proving that evolution
          doesn’t stop at the individual. Groups compete. Groups evolve. And
          that changes everything we thought we knew about economics, religion,
          politics, and human nature.
        </p>

        <blockquote
          class="border-l-2 border-cyan pl-6 my-9 reveal"
          style="transition-delay:0.16s"
        >
          <p class="headline text-2xl md:text-3xl text-cyan-glow leading-tight">
            “Adaptation at any level requires selection at that level — and is
            undermined by selection at the level below.”
          </p>
          <cite class="mono-label text-white/40 not-italic mt-3 block">— David Sloan Wilson</cite>
        </blockquote>

        <div class="reveal" style="transition-delay:0.2s">
          <a href="/david-sloan-wilson" class="btn btn-primary">The case for DSW →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
